  {
   "id": "heavenly-bodies-121697@major-2022-11-17",
   "gameId": "heavenly-bodies-121697",
   "displayName": "Update Notes for Nov 17",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-11-17T05:29:00.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey all!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's been a while since we've pushed a patch, but we have some little updates that make us very happy to share with you today.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Biggest of all: Many controller support issues, particularly on macOS are now fixed. Specifically:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Support for Nintendo Switch Pro Controllers has been added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Support for wireless DualShock4 and DualSense controllers has been added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Secondly, but still importantly: We've fixed a few small gameplay issues:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed in Energy mission where the ratchet can get stuck in the wall",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed issue in Vision where the bay door lever can be hard to locate",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the cursed asteroid in Minerals that flew around when being grabbed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you continue to experience any issues, please don't hesitate to post in the forums or contact us directly via help@2pt.com.au. We're just a 2 person team, so having your help in squashing these hard-to-find bugs means so much to us.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
